00:00:07.043 --> 00:00:09.570
- I will be Dwight to my, to my grave.

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:11.460
- I will be the girl that
sings "Since You've Been Gone."

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.720
So we're, here we go.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.147
- You sang that?

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.060
I love that song.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.990
- That's that's what I
will be, so it's like.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.920
- Well, you were also, "Kelly Clarkson"!

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.090
- Yes, that too.
- You were also that.

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:22.140
- Thank you, Steve Carell.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:23.883
Yes, yes, there's that as well.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.066
- Yeah, what was the question?

00:00:26.066 --> 00:00:27.810
- That's all I've done in my whole career.

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:28.830
That's what I would say.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.360
No, are you, 'cause do you,

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.680
