00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.300
So you were at dentist's
office, put on a mask

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.508
because the woman next to me
has a Dunder Mifflin shirt on.

00:00:39.508 --> 00:00:40.341
(audience laughs)

00:00:40.341 --> 00:00:43.110
Which you have to be a
hardcore fan, I'm just saying.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:44.670
- Yeah.
- To be wearing that shirt.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:47.130
So one, did your root canal go well?

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:48.270
'Cause you were at the dentist.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:50.220
And I heard it was a root canal, but two

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:51.930
do you get nervous in that situation?

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:52.763
'Cause you're trapped.

00:00:52.763 --> 00:00:53.596
You're like trapped there,

00:00:53.596 --> 00:00:56.040
so you can't be like
nice and then head off.

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:57.690
- Yeah, I was going in without a mask

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.160
and I saw her and her kid

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.190
