00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:22.343
and you've talked about it

00:01:22.343 --> 00:01:23.326
and you're just sitting
so closely together.

00:01:23.326 --> 00:01:24.930
- Right, and you're just sitting there.

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.000
- That's the awkward
part, when you're like,

